# API keys can be entered directly in the app under "API keys" in the header.
# That is the recommended route: they stay in your browser, nothing is committed,
# and the deployed page stays safe to share.
#
# The variables below are a convenience for local development only. Anything
# prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build time and is
# therefore PUBLIC — use a throwaway free key, never a paid one, and never for a
# deployment you share.
#
# The app runs fully on bundled sample data with none of these set.

# Company profile, fundamentals, valuation and the analyst consensus.
# Free key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# 25 requests/day, end-of-day data; educational projects can request more.
VITE_ALPHAVANTAGE_KEY=

# Daily price history for the chart. Optional.
# Free key: https://twelvedata.com/pricing
VITE_TWELVEDATA_KEY=

# Live news headlines. Optional.
# Free key: https://newsdata.io/
VITE_NEWSDATA_KEY=

# Narrative summary of the investment thesis. Optional.
# Key: https://openrouter.ai/
VITE_OPENROUTER_KEY=

# --- Backend proxy (recommended for anything shared) --------------------------
# Point this at a serverless function that holds the real keys server-side.
# See "Keeping the key off the client" in the README.
VITE_API_PROXY_URL=
